GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule activity`
`Part A row 2 (grade 2 licence): the installation works` MEANS `Part A row 1 (grade 1 licence): the installation works`

@ref First Schedule Part A, row 3 (src:519-523)
GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule activity`
`Part A row 3 (grade 3 licence): the installation works` MEANS `Part A row 1 (grade 1 licence): the installation works`

