-- src:558 | {{ח:תת|(2)}} בדיקה, החלפה, שינוי, פירוק, תיקון או טיפול במערכת קרר וברכיביו החשמליים והמכניים;
-- src:559 | {{ח:תת|(3)}} הוספה או החלפה של שמן במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר
-- src:560 | </td></tr>
@ref First Schedule Part B, row 3 (src:554-560)
GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule activity`
`Part B row 3 (grade 3 licence): the maintenance works` MEANS
    append `Part B row 1 (grade 1 licence): the maintenance works`
           (LIST `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components`
               , `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`)

-- Every activity of the enumeration, in the Law's order.  The tests assert that this list and the three Part
-- lists of the grade 3 rows between them hold every constructor exactly once.
@ref First Schedule, Part A and Part B, Column B (src:498-523; src:531-560)
GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule activity`
`every First Schedule activity` MEANS
    append `Part A row 3 (grade 3 licence): the installation works`
           `Part B row 3 (grade 3 licence): the maintenance works`

-- The Part (installation or maintenance) that lists the activity.  Part A is the installation works and Part B
-- the maintenance works, by the headings of the two Parts.
-- src:493 | {{ח:קטע3|תוספת 1 חלק א|חלק א׳: עבודות התקנה הטעונות רישיון}}
-- src:526 | {{ח:קטע3|תוספת 1 חלק ב|חלק ב׳: עבודות תחזוקה הטעונות רישיון}}
@ref First Schedule, headings of Part A (src:493) and Part B (src:526)
@desc Whether the First Schedule lists the activity as an installation work (Part A) or a maintenance work (Part B); derived from the activity, so a job kind recorded elsewhere can be checked against it
GIVEN activity IS A `First Schedule activity`
GIVETH A `Job kind`
`the job kind of the activity` activity MEANS
    IF   elem activity `Part A row 1 (grade 1 licence): the installation works`
    THEN `an installation job`
    ELSE `a maintenance job`

@ref First Schedule, headings of Part A (src:493) and Part B (src:526)
@desc True if the job kind recorded for a piece of work is the Part of the First Schedule that lists the activity
GIVEN activity IS A `First Schedule activity`
      job IS A `Job kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the job kind agrees with the First Schedule part of the activity` activity job MEANS
    `the job kind of the activity` activity EQUALS job

-- Column B of the row for a licence kind, in the Part for a job kind.
@ref First Schedule, Column A and Column B (src:498-523; src:531-560)
GIVEN kind IS A `Licence kind`
      job IS A `Job kind`
GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule activity`
`the works listed in column B for` kind `in the part for` job MEANS
    CONSIDER job
    WHEN `an installation job` THEN
        CONSIDER kind
        WHEN `grade 1 licence` THEN `Part A row 1 (grade 1 licence): the installation works`
        WHEN `grade 2 licence` THEN `Part A row 2 (grade 2 licence): the installation works`
        WHEN `grade 3 licence` THEN `Part A row 3 (grade 3 licence): the installation works`
    WHEN `a maintenance job` THEN
        CONSIDER kind
        WHEN `grade 1 licence` THEN `Part B row 1 (grade 1 licence): the maintenance works`
        WHEN `grade 2 licence` THEN `Part B row 2 (grade 2 licence): the maintenance works`
        WHEN `grade 3 licence` THEN `Part B row 3 (grade 3 licence): the maintenance works`

@ref First Schedule, Column A and Column B (src:498-523; src:531-560)
@export Which licence kinds the First Schedule lists the activity under: the kinds whose row of Column A has the activity in its Column B; this is the activity half of "the kind appropriate", the capacity half is section 2
GIVEN activity IS A `First Schedule activity` @desc The First Schedule activity the act amounts to
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`licence kinds that may do the activity` activity MEANS
    filter (GIVEN kind YIELD elem activity (`the works listed in column B for` kind `in the part for` (`the job kind of the activity` activity)))
           (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)

-- Trap T9: an act that two items both describe.  B.1(3) lets grade 1 "check, replace, change, dismantle, repair
-- mechanical and electrical components of a cooling system"; B.3(2) reserves for grade 3 the same acts on "a refrigerant
-- system and its electrical and mechanical components".  Whether a compressor replacement is the first or the second is
-- a classification the caller makes; an act that BOTH items describe can be read two ways, both callable here.  Read
-- with Column A ("the kind appropriate ... as specified in column A"), a licence kind is appropriate if the Schedule
-- lists the act under it: at least one of the items that describe it (taken, the first function), or every one of them
-- (the second).  An act described by no item is not work, and no kind is listed for it.
@ref First Schedule, Column A and Column B (src:498-523; src:531-560); items B.1(3) (src:536) and B.3(2) (src:558)
@export The licence kinds that may do an act that the First Schedule describes under any of the given activities: a kind that is listed under at least one of them
GIVEN activities IS A LIST OF `First Schedule activity` @desc Every First Schedule activity that describes the act; empty if none does
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`licence kinds that may do an act described by any of the activities` activities MEANS
    filter (GIVEN kind YIELD any (GIVEN activity YIELD elem kind (`licence kinds that may do the activity` activity)) activities)
           (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)

@ref First Schedule, Column A and Column B (src:498-523; src:531-560); items B.1(3) (src:536) and B.3(2) (src:558)
@export The licence kinds that may do an act that the First Schedule describes under all of the given activities: a kind that is listed under every one of them
GIVEN activities IS A LIST OF `First Schedule activity` @desc Every First Schedule activity that describes the act; empty if none does
GIVETH A LIST OF `Licence kind`
`licence kinds that may do an act described by all of the activities` activities MEANS
    IF   null activities
    THEN EMPTY
    ELSE filter (GIVEN kind YIELD all (GIVEN activity YIELD elem kind (`licence kinds that may do the activity` activity)) activities)
                (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)

§§ `The limits of the items that say "only" (items A.1(11), A.1(12), B.1(14))`

-- The three items are limited by a fact about the act, not by the spelling of a defined term: the Schedule's
-- definition says "integral" with one letter and items A.1(12) and B.1(14) spell the word with an extra letter
-- (the gazette prints the extra letter too, p. 199 and p. 200).  A lookup of the term as a string would find
-- neither; this function keys on the fact the defined term states.
@ref First Schedule items A.1(11), A.1(12) and B.1(14); definitions "integral control and monitoring accessories" (src:472) and "integral electrical system" (src:486)
GIVEN activity IS A `First Schedule activity`
      facts IS A `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the act stays within the limits of the First Schedule item` activity facts MEANS
    CONSIDER activity
    WHEN `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only` THEN facts's `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only`
    WHEN `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` THEN facts's `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only`
    WHEN `B.1(14) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` THEN facts's `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only`
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `The defined terms of the First Schedule: the two that limit an item`

@desc The facts about a part that accompanies a cooling system, for the Schedule's definition of integral control and monitoring accessories
DECLARE `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule` HAS
    `permanently connected to the system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the part is connected to the system in a fixed way
    `used to monitor the function of the installation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the part serves for monitoring the function of the installation
    `used to warn of the function of the installation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the part serves for warning of the function of the installation
    `used to control the function of the installation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the part serves for control of the function of the installation

-- src:472 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”אביזרי פיקוד ובקרה אינטגרליים“ – חלקים נלווים למערכת המחוברים באופן קבוע והמשמשים לניטור, התראה ושליטה על תפקוד המיתקן;
@ref First Schedule definition "integral control and monitoring accessories" (src:472)
GIVEN part IS A `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory` part MEANS
        part's `permanently connected to the system`
    AND (   part's `used to monitor the function of the installation`
         OR part's `used to warn of the function of the installation`
         OR part's `used to control the function of the installation`)

-- The same definition read with "monitoring, warning and control" as three functions the part must ALL serve.
@ref First Schedule definition "integral control and monitoring accessories" (src:472)
GIVEN part IS A `Facts about a part accompanying a system under the First Schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the part is an integral control and monitoring accessory, serving all three functions` part MEANS
        part's `permanently connected to the system`
    AND part's `used to monitor the function of the installation`
    AND part's `used to warn of the function of the installation`
    AND part's `used to control the function of the installation`

@desc The facts about an electrical system of a cooling system, for the Schedule's definition of the integral electrical system
DECLARE `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule` HAS
    `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the electrical system is dedicated to the cooling system and forms part of it
    `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the electrical system is part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system
    `supplied by the manufacturer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the manufacturer supplied it
    `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if it was supplied to the manufacturer's requirements
    `intended for the cooling system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if it is intended for the cooling system

-- src:486 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מערכת החשמל האינטגרלית של מערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר“ – מערכת ייעודית המהווה חלק ממערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר (חלק מהלוח הייעודי של מערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר, המסופק על ידי היצרן או לדרישותיו או מיועד לכך);
@ref First Schedule definition "integral electrical system" (src:486); spelled with an extra letter in items A.1(12) and B.1(14)
GIVEN system IS AN `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system` system MEANS
        system's `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system`
    AND system's `part of the dedicated panel of the cooling system`
    AND (   system's `supplied by the manufacturer`
         OR system's `supplied to the requirements of the manufacturer`
         OR system's `intended for the cooling system`)

-- The same definition read with the parenthesis as an illustration: only "a dedicated system that is part of a
-- cooling system" is required.
@ref First Schedule definition "integral electrical system" (src:486)
GIVEN system IS AN `Facts about an electrical system of a cooling system under the First Schedule`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the electrical system is the integral electrical system of the cooling system, the parenthesis read as an illustration` system MEANS
    system's `a dedicated system forming part of the cooling system`

§§ `The defined terms of the First Schedule: the glossary, carried as text`

-- Eighteen definitions that decide nothing: no rule computes on them.  Each is carried as its quotation and a
-- gloss, so that a reader of the work items can find what the word means.  The glosses are mine; the Hebrew governs.
-- Three of them (expansion tank, condenser coil, refrigerant distribution valves) appear in no work item of either
-- Part, and the defined term "heat exchanger" appears in none either (item B.1(12) names a condenser or an
-- evaporator, which that definition mentions).

-- src:473 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”הרצת מערכת קירור ומיזוג אוויר“ – הפעלה ראשונית של מערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר ובדיקת אופייני הפעולה (כגון זרמים חשמליים, לחצים של קרר, טמפרטורות, טמפרטורות אוויר, ספיקת אוויר, דליפות קרר);
@ref First Schedule definition "commissioning" (src:473)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: commissioning` MEANS "first operation of a cooling or air-conditioning system and testing of its operating characteristics (such as electric currents, refrigerant pressures, temperatures, air temperatures, air flow and refrigerant leaks); the gloss of item A.1(7)"

-- src:474 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”השבת קררים“ – הוצאת הקרר ממיתקן הקירור והחזרתו למערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant recovery" (src:474)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant recovery` MEANS "removing the refrigerant from the cooling installation and returning it to the cooling or air-conditioning system; the gloss of the refrigerant-handling items"

-- src:475 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ואקום“ – הוצאת אוויר מתוך מערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר לפני הכנסת קרר;
@ref First Schedule definition "vacuum" (src:475)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: vacuum` MEANS "removing air from the cooling or air-conditioning system before refrigerant is introduced; the gloss of the refrigerant-handling item A.1(5)"

-- src:476 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”יחידה חיצונית“ – יחידת עיבוי המותקנת מחוץ לחלל הממוזג;
@ref First Schedule definition "outdoor unit" (src:476)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: outdoor unit` MEANS "a condensing unit installed outside the conditioned space; the gloss of item A.1(4)"

-- src:477 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”יחידה פנימית“ – יחידת אידוי המותקנת בתוך החלל הממוזג;
@ref First Schedule definition "indoor unit" (src:477)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: indoor unit` MEANS "an evaporator unit installed inside the conditioned space; the gloss of items A.1(2) and A.1(4)"

-- src:478 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”יחידת מפוח נחשון“ – יחידה המבצעת את פעולת הקירור או חימום האוויר;
@ref First Schedule definition "fan-coil unit" (src:478)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: fan-coil unit` MEANS "a unit that cools or heats air; the gloss of item B.1(8)"

-- src:479 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מדף ממונע“ – מדף ממונע בתעלת אוויר המיועד לשמש כמדף אש, כמדף עשן או כמדף ויסות;
@ref First Schedule definition "motorised damper" (src:479)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: motorised damper` MEANS "a motorised damper in an air duct meant to serve as a fire damper, a smoke damper or a regulating damper; the gloss of item B.1(10)"

-- src:480 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מחליף חום“ – מיתקן שייעודו להעביר חום בין הקרר לאוויר או למים, ובכלל זה מעבה או מאייד מקורר אוויר או מקורר מים;
@ref First Schedule definition "heat exchanger" (src:480)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: heat exchanger` MEANS "equipment meant to transfer heat between refrigerant and air or water, including an air-cooled or water-cooled condenser or evaporator; no work item uses the term, and item B.1(12) speaks of a condenser or evaporator"

-- src:481 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מיחזור קררים“ – הוצאת הקרר ממיתקן הקירור, ניקויו והחזרתו למערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant recycling" (src:481)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant recycling` MEANS "removing the refrigerant from the cooling installation, cleaning it and returning it to the cooling or air-conditioning system; the gloss of the refrigerant-handling items"

-- src:482 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מילוי קרר“ – הוספת חומר קירור למערכת במידה שקבע היצרן;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant charging" (src:482)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant charging` MEANS "adding cooling material to a system in the amount the manufacturer set; the gloss of the refrigerant-handling items"

-- src:483 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מכל התפשטות“ – מכל המאפשר קליטה של עודפי מים המתפשטים עקב התחממותם;
@ref First Schedule definition "expansion tank" (src:483)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: expansion tank` MEANS "a vessel that takes up the excess of water that expands on heating; no work item uses the term"

-- src:484 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מערכת אדם לכוד“ – מנגנון להתרעה והגנה מפני אדם לכוד בחדר הקירור;
@ref First Schedule definition "entrapped-person system" (src:484)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: entrapped-person system` MEANS "a mechanism to warn of and protect against a person trapped in a cold room; the gloss of item B.1(11)"

-- src:485 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מערכת הולכת הקרר“ – צנרת ואביזרים שונים שבהם זורם הקרר בצורה מחזורית ליצירת אפקט הקירור;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant-carrying system" (src:485)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant-carrying system` MEANS "piping and various fittings through which the refrigerant circulates to create the cooling effect; the gloss of items A.1(6) and A.1(9)"

-- src:487 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”סוללת עיבוי“ – סוללה המשמשת כמחליף חום לפליטת החום שנקלט בחלל הממוזג;
@ref First Schedule definition "condenser coil" (src:487)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: condenser coil` MEANS "a coil serving as a heat exchanger to release the heat taken up in the conditioned space; no work item uses the term"

-- src:488 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”צ׳ילר“ – יחידת קירור או חימום מים מרכזית;
@ref First Schedule definition "chiller" (src:488)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: chiller` MEANS "a central unit for cooling or heating water; the gloss of items B.1(8) and B.1(13)"

-- src:489 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ריקון קרר“ – הוצאת קרר ממערכת הקירור או מיזוג האוויר;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant emptying" (src:489)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant emptying` MEANS "removing refrigerant from the cooling or air-conditioning system; the gloss of the refrigerant-handling items"

-- src:490 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”שסתומי חלוקת הקרר“ – מערכת לניווט הקרר לחלל הרלוונטי;
@ref First Schedule definition "refrigerant distribution valves" (src:490)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: refrigerant distribution valves` MEANS "a system for routing the refrigerant to the relevant space; no work item uses the term"

-- src:491 | {{ח:ת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”תושבת ייעודית“ – מתלה קשיח שעליו מונחת היחידה החיצונית.
@ref First Schedule definition "dedicated bracket" (src:491)
GIVETH A STRING
`First Schedule term: dedicated bracket` MEANS "a rigid rack on which the outdoor unit stands; the gloss of item A.1(4)"
